There was a man who had a withered and bent hand. The Pharisees were trying to find fault with Jesus. So they said to him, "Is it lawful to heal on the Sabbath?"
And he said to them, "What if one of your sheep falls into a pit on the Sabbath? Wouldn't you grab it and pull it out?"
A man is of more value than a sheep! Therefore, the law permits us to do good on the Sabbath.
